SELECT 'Assembly' AS Station, 62 AS Amount, 70 AS Target, 18 AS Intensity INTO #station_load
UNION ALL SELECT 'Paint', 81, 70, 64
UNION ALL SELECT 'Trim', 74, 70, 45
UNION ALL SELECT 'Final QA', 55, 70, 92;

CREATE VISUAL StationLoad AS CUSTOM (
  TITLE = 'Sequential quantitative colour with a per-category target tick',
  SOURCE = #station_load,
  CHART (
    COORDINATE (TYPE = CARTESIAN),
    SCALES (
      stations = BAND (CHANNEL = X, INCLUDE_ZERO = OFF, ORDER = SOURCE),
      amounts = LINEAR (CHANNEL = Y, INCLUDE_ZERO = ON, MIN = 0, MAX = 100),
      intensity = LINEAR (
        CHANNEL = COLOR,
        MIN = 0,
        MAX = 100,
        RANGE = GRADIENT(LOW = '#e0f2fe', HIGH = '#0c4a6e')
      )
    ),
    LAYERS (
      load_bars = RECT (
        Z_INDEX = 0,
        ENCODINGS (
          X = Station (TYPE = NOMINAL, SCALE = stations),
          Y = Amount (TYPE = QUANTITATIVE, SCALE = amounts),
          COLOR = Intensity (TYPE = QUANTITATIVE, SCALE = intensity)
        )
      ),
      target = TICK (
        Z_INDEX = 1,
        BAND_SIZE = 0.9,
        THICKNESS = 0.25,
        ORIENTATION = HORIZONTAL,
        ENCODINGS (
          X = Station (TYPE = NOMINAL, SCALE = stations),
          Y = Target (TYPE = QUANTITATIVE, SCALE = amounts),
          TOOLTIP = VALUE('Target') (TYPE = NOMINAL)
        )
      )
    )
  )
);

CREATE PAGE Main AS DASHBOARD (STRUCTURE = 'A', MAP ('A' = StationLoad));
